&lt;p&gt;please review the license to understand your rights and obligations.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnote-ref&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mawoka-myblock/ClassQuiz/master/#fn1&quot; id=&quot;fnref1&quot;&gt;[1]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
